WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.820
Here's some good news.

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.190
You know, everyone's reading
the bad news all the time.

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:06.020
I like to focus on the good news,

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.830
and I like to use this
accent when I do it.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:11.610
Over 100 million Americans have received

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.330
at least one dose of the COVID vaccine.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.060
That's fantastic, yeah.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.960
And clear signs of hope
that we are nearing the end

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.210
of the pandemic are all around us.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.210
And I was watching television
last night and I saw,

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:30.360
well, I saw a sign of that hope in an ad

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.770
that ran on TV just last night
around 10 o'clock at night.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:38.830
I recorded it 'cause
I think this is a sign

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:41.130
that maybe we're turning a
corner on this COVID thing.

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:41.963
Check it out.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.830
[Announcer] People are getting vaxxed,

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.560
so guess what's coming back?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.350
Mouths!
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:49.183
Mouths!

00:00:50.263 --> 00:00:53.563
♪ Mouths, mouths, mouths, mouths, mouths ♪

00:00:53.563 --> 00:00:55.397
♪ Get ready for mouths ♪

00:00:55.397 --> 00:00:57.950
♪ Get ready for mouths ♪

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:01.962
♪ Take off your mask
and show us your mouth ♪

00:01:01.962 --> 00:01:06.500
♪ Mouths, mouths, mouths ♪

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.230
♪ Mouths, mouths, mouths, mouths, mouths ♪

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:12.600
I have no idea what they're selling there.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.560
Yeah, I don't either.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:16.090
I kind of want to call the
number just to find out.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:17.420
Yeah, oh I definitely will,

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:20.260
the minute we're done
here, I'm on the phone.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.990
Okay, (laughs) good.

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:24.000
I also found it kind of erotic too.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.700
Yes, of course.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.347
That's just me, I've
always been, you know.

00:01:27.347 --> 00:01:28.180
[Andy] Mouths.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.903
That way long before
COVID, I was into mouths.

